<title>HONG KONG: HK weather - cloudy with occasional rain.</title>
<headline>HK weather - cloudy with occasional rain.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weather will be cloudy with occasional rain, the Royal Observatory said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The maximum temperature will be 28 C with moderate northeasterly winds.</p>
<p>At 7 a.m., the temperature was 24 C and the relative humidity was 96 percent.</p>
<p>Outlook for tomorrow: cloudy with rain.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
